title: "Nasdaq Range Forecaster"
abstract: >-
  Calibrated daily high/low prediction bands for NQ, ES and the Nasdaq Composite,
  with walk-forward validation, a measured accuracy ceiling, and a TradingView
  (Pine v5) implementation.
